//in scene, GM is present then leaves to help people/take care of business
BeginningScene:
DifficultySwapper
MUSC 0x0
Text(FillerDialogue)
MUSC Song_PandemonicPlanet
LOAD1 0x1 EnemyUnits; ENUN
LOAD1 0x1 KrystJoin; ENUN
//starting skills
//kryst - level 1 soothing voice/bravery/shelter/mercury/insight
LevelUpSkill(Kryst,0)
LevelUpSkill(Kryst,7)
LevelUpSkill(Kryst,8)
LevelUpSkill(Kryst,9)
LevelUpSkill(Kryst,10)
MUSC 0x0
Text(FillerDialogue)
CallPreps
TurnAlly(Kryst)
MUSC Song_FaithIsMyPillar
Text(FillerDialogue) //nathan comments on wolf, gets paper thrown at him
EndEvent

EndbringerLeaves:
CAM1 [15,0]
FlashCursor(Xavens,30)
Text(FillerDialogue)
STAL 10
CAM1 Xavens
WARPOUT [9,1]
SilentKillUnit(Xavens)
ENDWARP
CAM1 Egil
WARPOUT [10,1]
SilentKillUnit(Egil)
ENDWARP
CAM1 Harla
WARPOUT [18,1]
SilentKillUnit(Harla)
ENDWARP
EndEvent

EndingScene:
ENUT Chapter5DoneFlag
MUSC 0x0
CleanTextNoMap(0x18,FillerDialogue)
MoveToChapter(HirschringSquare)
ENDA


